{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Line Up! is a chaotic, couch multiplayer game where you take on the role of a caring Mama trying to guide your adorable, easily confused little babies lined up through the bustling world. Other critters are doing the same, and they won\u2019t hesitate to defend their little ones with everything they\u2019ve got!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master the art of leading, outsmart your rivals, and maybe some fun dancing to create the <strong>longest line of babies in the game</strong>. But beware: every bump, distraction, or mischievous opponent can send your little ones to the wrong line!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong></strong><br><br><strong>EAT! AND MAKE BABIES!</strong><br><strong> </strong>Food is always the answer! Munch away!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2693230/extras/6f4ba18c9ae0caada760d2170491b4eb.poster.avif?t=1763302502\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2693230/extras/6f4ba18c9ae0caada760d2170491b4eb.webm?t=1763302502\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2693230/extras/6f4ba18c9ae0caada760d2170491b4eb.mp4?t=1763302502\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>SCARE! RIVAL MAMA AWAY!</strong><br><strong> </strong>Shoo! Get away from my babies!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2693230/extras/d233dd03f1c22ce6858a63bdae64060c.poster.avif?t=1763302502\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2693230/extras/d233dd03f1c22ce6858a63bdae64060c.webm?t=1763302502\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https